  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Task Force for Business and Stability Operations (TFBSO) Programs (NDAA-funded): Private Sector Investment.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TFBSO Private Sector Investment - Herat support. Implementing Partner: Muscogee Nation Business Enterprise. TFBSO promotes business growth and entrepreneurship by providing business management consulting to small- and medium-sized enterprises and conducting due diligence on Afghan companies to develop a pipeline for potential investors. TFBSO experts in financial analysis, accounting, business strategy, operations management, and engineering provide business management consulting and introduce firms to potential global investment partners. Working closely with international financial institutions and private investment fund managers, the Investment Team surveys the business landscape of Afghanistan for investors and helps facilitate commercial deals.</narrative>
  </description>
